    "title": "City of Fayetteville taps construction contractor for Fire Station No. 4 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Report, posted ,\n1 days ago The Fayetteville City Council voted Monday to negotiate a contract with Samet Corporation as the construction manager for Fire Station No. 4. Selecting a construction manager reflects the City’s strong efforts to complete the station, which broke ground in 2022. The move follows last month’s hiring of industry-leading project manager Cumming Group to oversee site preparation and rebuild through completion and occupancy of the new station. The agreement with Samet Corporation will include $400,000 for preconstruction costs. Read full article\n1",
